  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: managesieve-login pre-auth excessive memory usage\n     DoS via oversized AUTHENTICATE initial response (ELSCVE-158963)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-27858.patch: verify the AUTHENTICATE\n       initial response size is not too large before allocating in\n       pigeonhole/src/managesieve-login/client-authenticate.c. Backport\n       of upstream pigeonhole commit 54f645225a8a: the five added lines are\n       byte-identical to upstream, while the hunk context is this tree's\n       pre-cc1b8988 (unreformatted) layout, which is why the blob index\n       differs from upstream's.\n     - CVE-2026-27858",
